    "created_at": "2022-07-12T17:48:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-07-12T17:48:46Z",
    "body": "There is a performance penalty but it is unavoidable in order to work around this particularly picky device behavior. The firmware should be fixed to not make invalid assumptions about how the driver constructs USB packets from the data provided by the application.",
